//   Layer 1 — kernel-level (this file, runnable today): asserts the
//             ggml_concat dtype-uniformity precondition that the CUDA
//             backend kernel guards at concat.cu:202. Reproduces the
//             exact crash signature observed in production
//             (snoop-20260505T111847) by issuing a heterogeneous-dtype
//             concat. RED today (the assert fires, the process aborts).
//             Once the layer-side fix lands, the test is satisfied
//             vacuously because the kernel no longer sees mismatched
